This section is mechanically derived from the plugin source. Every page
under `reference/` is regenerated by `sdlc docs generate site` from the
matching source in `plugin/`. Do not edit pages here by hand — edit the
source, then re-run `sdlc docs generate site`.

- [Skills](/reference/skills/) — one page per `solutions/ontological/plugin/plugins/sdlc/skills/<name>/<name>.md`.
- [Entities](/reference/entities/) — one page per `solutions/ontological/lib/model/entities/<type>/schema.ts`.
- [Ops](/reference/ops/) — one page per registered path in the op registry (`solutions/ontological/lib/registry.ts`).
